# A scooter wheelie nobody balances (physics phase 31): up then down quickly at speed lifts the front, and
# with no hand on up and down its balance runs away like a manual's: 2.6 s later the rider is thrown off
# beside it (bail: fell off the scooter, the wheelie lost) and the scooter lies on its side, stopped. The
# ride still ends (scooterRideEnd).
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 teleport 358.9 323.7 -1.08 45
tap use 30
hold up 40..398
tap up 400
tap down 406
run 1000
expect event manualStart{trick=Scooter Wheelie} within 405..409
expect event scooterRideEnd within 714..718
expect event comboLost{name=Scooter Wheelie} within 714..718
expect event bail{reason=fell off the scooter} within 714..718
expect state bail at 760
expect van.car.drive.ride.tipped == 1 at 760
expect van.hspeed < 0.01 at 760
expect no event comboLanded
